  "body": "## What\n\nAdd `review:preflight`, `pr:wait-check`, and `checkpoint:closure-audit` mise tasks. Add a scheduled read-only closure audit, a Codex documentation brief template, fixtures, and pure core tests.\n\n## Why\n\nThe phase 1 retrospective found missing workflow checks on an old branch, prose rework, an early check-wait return, and an issue closure before its check finished.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHarness: Codex CLI 0.157.1. Model: `gpt-6-sol` at high effort.\n\n[Coordinator preflight evidence](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/tooling/70-73-coordinator-preflight/reports/inputs/coordinator-preflight-70-73-evidence-2026-09-26.md) records the fixture outcomes, live task output, local checks, and the sandbox limit on Chromium.\n\n`mise run check` passed with 16 Python tests passed and one existing integration test skipped. `mise run build` passed. The secret scan found no leaks in the evidence file.\n\n## Docs\n\nUpdate the workflow and tooling pages with each check's trigger and link the phase 1 retrospective. Add the brief template, sample brief, and sample page.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] CI green\n- [x] Docs updated\n- [x] No secrets\n- [x] Evidence committed\n\nRefs: #70\nRefs: #71\nRefs: #72\nRefs: #73\n",
